      "path": "src/ui/screens/replay-strip.props.ts",
      "content": "A run containing only one valid P\u0026L observation produces only an SVG `M` command, which draws nothing. Consequently, one-session trades (and isolated observations separated by missing marks) show reference lines but no visible trade P\u0026L. Render a point marker for singleton runs, and add coverage for one-session and missing/valid/missing histories.",
