    },
    {
      "path": "src/ui/screens/CardReplay.tsx",
      "content": "Replay can now be opened from Reflections, but this Price History link does not carry the originating panel. TradeDetail's “Back to the Review” link still hardcodes `panel=Action` (`TradeDetail.tsx:178`), so opening Replay from a walked card's Reflections panel, visiting Price History, and returning switches the card to Action. Carry the current `panel` through the Detail URL and use it in the return link, with a round-trip test starting from Reflections.",
